      "color": "orange",
      "text": "Long Read. An essay: a serif reading column with margin notes; figures and tables break out wide; numbers live in sentences.\n\nLayout: 640-px reading column plus a 300-px margin-note column; figures span both; one pull quote per page.\nThe memorable thing: Live prices written into the prose, with margin notes carrying the definitions.\nType: Newsreader 400/600 (and italic) for headlines and text; Public Sans for notes, tables, forms and charts.\nLight: bg #FFFFFF, surf #F7F6F4, ink #1A1A1A, muted #66625C, acc #9E1B32, line #DAD7D2\nDark: bg #121412, surf #1A1C1A, ink #E6E8E3, muted #9A9E97, acc #FF6B81, line #333733\nMagnet rail on the left edge. Live prices on these boards are NSE closing prices from 25 Sep 2026; every chart is drawn from real data or the project's pricer."
    }
